# Environment Variables Configuration

# Google AI API Key (required for chat widget)
# Get your API key from: https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
GOOGLE_GENAI_API_KEY=your_google_ai_api_key_here

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file and rename it to .env.local
# 2. Replace 'your_google_ai_api_key_here' with your actual Google AI API key
# 3. Restart your development server (npm run dev)
# 4. The .env.local file is already in .gitignore and won't be committed
